00:03:11.501 --> 00:03:12.734
-20, 30K.

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:13.901
-That's it?

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:15.801
Geez, maybe I should get
something like that.

00:03:15.801 --> 00:03:17.701
-You're gonna have to lose
an arm for that.

00:03:17.701 --> 00:03:19.834
-I wasn't talking
about for the arm.

00:03:19.834 --> 00:03:22.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.701
-Come on! That's a stud!
-You know what I'm saying.

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:25.901
-That is a stud!
-Handsome bastard.

00:03:25.901 --> 00:03:27.033
-That's a handsome man.

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:28.467
-One of the best-looking men
in America.

00:03:28.467 --> 00:03:29.834
-Adam Sandler, everybody.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:32.400
"Murder Mystery 2"
premieres globally

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.501
